        "detail": "<div class=\"detailmodule_html\"><div class=\"detail-desc-decorate-richtext\"><p class=\"word-break white-space mt-10\" style=\"text-align:left;color:#434649;font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;\">FzcSpeed<br>\nProduct Name: Golf Wooden Tees<br>\nMaterial: Natural Hardwood, Smooth Surface Without Burrs<br>\nSpecifications: 42mm / 54mm /70mm /83mm<br>\nColors: Assorted Colors<br>\nPackaging: 10/20/30/50/100 Tees per Pack<br>\nApplicable Scenarios: Driving Range Practice, Suitable for Irons/Woods/Hybrids<br>\nFeatures: Low-Spin Shallow Cup Design, High-Visibility Colors, Break-Resistant Strengthened Treatment</p>\n\n<p class=\"word-break white-space mt-10\" style=\"text-align:left;font-size:16px;font-weight:bold;\">Product Advantages</p>\n\n<p class=\"word-break white-space mt-10\" style=\"text-align:left;color:#434649;font-size:16px;font-weight:normal;\">Professional-Grade Durable Material: Made of high-strength organic hardwood – impact-resistant and break-resistant, withstands repeated swings for lasting stability.<br>\n<br>\nLow-Spin Design: Shallow cup reduces contact area between the ball and tee, minimizing spin to help you achieve longer, straighter shots.<br>\n<br>\nHigh-Visibility Colors: Available in fluorescent pink, bright orange, vibrant green, and more – easy to spot on the grass, no more hunting for tees.<br>\n<br>\nFour Height Options: Available in 42mm, 54mm, 70mm, and 83mm – suitable for drivers, irons, hybrids, and various club needs.<br>\n<br>\nPortable Set: Transparent self-sealing bag – dust-proof and easy to carry, perfect for restocking on the go.</p>\n<img cke-id=\"img78\" height=\"1500\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sf3f2104c3ae14eb797387520c3ce8cedF.jpg?width=1500&height=1500&hash=3000\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"1500\"><img cke-id=\"img79\" height=\"603\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S3f705365abff417a82225ac424d32964Q.jpg?width=706&height=603&hash=1309\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"706\"><img cke-id=\"img80\" height=\"1500\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S20258d43f38f4854855e8f92cd51f058r.jpg?width=1500&height=1500&hash=3000\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"1500\"><img cke-id=\"img81\" height=\"1500\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sb4701ef2abaf4d0682c6c34635062b56l.jpg?width=1500&height=1500&hash=3000\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"1500\"><img cke-id=\"img82\" height=\"1500\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S31eafe33682540ed82c967f18915a100U.jpg?width=1500&height=1500&hash=3000\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"1500\"><img cke-id=\"img83\" height=\"1500\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Scde4ca25a4bd49b28a87c14dd797dc77Y.jpg?width=1500&height=1500&hash=3000\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"1500\"><img cke-id=\"img84\" height=\"1500\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Seda5cb5f420142a4988699076d22e234E.jpg?width=1500&height=1500&hash=3000\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"1500\"><img cke-id=\"img85\" height=\"1500\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/Sbe65c77919f944a8bbaa9e6558ec365aA.jpg?width=1500&height=1500&hash=3000\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; vertical-align: middle;\" width=\"1500\"><img cke-id=\"img86\" height=\"1500\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://ae-pic-a1.aliexpress-media.com/kf/S062d510572ea48d4af275d747da302da8.jpg?width=1500&height=1500&hash=3000\" style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; vertical-align: middle;